text:
@user-xt5lt9ic2m  I dont think that would happen if Kai went solo and disbanded his own group. 

No one survived Solo while leaving SM so far, if I am not mistaken. 
I am Super Junior new fans, and I think Kai and the rest of SM idol can follow their way. Keeping the group alive and getting strong, and at the same time running your own Solo even under different agency. I hope that when Kai is out from the military, he can see that way, too.
